{"v":4,"catch":"如今，追尋英雄軌跡與真相的故事正式展開――――","desc":"迷宮都市歐拉麗在那一天，毫無預兆地發生了巨大的變化。\n在被水淹沒的歐拉麗中，貝爾一行人追尋著英雄譚中登場人物們的足跡。\n他們所目睹的，是『水與光的芙蘭德』中未曾描述過的，交錯交織的眾多情感。\n\n如今，追尋英雄軌跡與真相的故事正式展開――――\n\n這是一款操作貝爾・克朗尼和艾絲・華倫斯坦，擊敗怪物，推進關卡，朝著故事的結局邁進的，橫向捲軸動作RPG。","publisher":"Bushiroad","release":"2025-03-13","genres":["動作","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日文","英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 1.5GB / Switch 1.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/25207d2530b8f2eb1275dd59fde5795d76c6b35688fefd3101eba729e7d6feb0.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c958cce7b4a0944a26da444adecf869dfd60295923035e7eddd2f960f80218d5.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/af6938e294d96bd6826042d8df7261ba12515d7255ac683b8a4eb54e84db5e68.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/45dbbd3f4a6c3e46c522723b29660565d62f283d33c6e6315f0f439b556160c3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dd954595f8adf87c11f233acc57b4b62c0b762acf920ad3dc5a696a2daf49b5f.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/305c4a8c030281a8ec91650f598e5447422aae73050e1cd2d3b9643672b85b2f.jpg"],"titleId":"0100c1d01f5c8000","dlc":[]}